'''''Microbryum''''' is a genus of [[mosses]] belonging to the family [[Pottiaceae]]. The genus has a [[cosmopolitan distribution]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Microbryum Schimp. |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2671417 |access-date=12 February 2021 |website=www.gbif.org |language=en}}</ref>

